WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.369
-We talk a lot about immigrants
right now.

00:00:02.369 --> 00:00:03.203 line:92%
We talk a lot about refugees.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:06.072
Your parents, your family has
this incredible story which is,

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.240 line:92%
as you mentioned, you came here,

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
you had a sponsor
in this country.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:11.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
It seems to have been
very welcoming

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.379 size:88% position:44% line:92%
in a way to your family.

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:16.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it a story that you feel
comfortable telling these days

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.717 line:92%
with everything going on?

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you know,
my natural inclination

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.955 line:92%
is to not talk about myself,

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:24.958 size:78% position:39%
which is why I'm here
on this talk show.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:25.925 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:31.598
But I think given the climate,
if it helps to share my story,

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:35.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
so it can humanize a refugee,
I'm happy to share it.

00:00:35.802 --> 00:00:40.206
But, you know, I also grew up --
I lived in government housing.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.641 line:92%
I needed government assistance.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:45.912 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was one of those kids
who needed lunch assistance,

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:47.247 line:92%
and that's been in the news.

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:50.650
I needed Pell Grants to go
to college and, you know,

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.287
I don't feel like
I'm a scourge to society, so...

00:00:54.287 --> 00:01:01.294 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's really just lovely
having you here.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you for sharing
that story,

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
and congratulations again
on your nomination.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:09.569
-Thank you.
-It's a delight to talk to you.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.271 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Hong Chau, everybody.

